<title>SPAIN: Argentaria interim dividend 128 ptas gross.</title>
<headline>Argentaria interim dividend 128 ptas gross.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish banking group Corporacion Bancaria de Espana (Argentaria) said on Thursday it would pay a first 1996 interim dividend of 128 pesetas gross on October 21.</p>
<p>Last year, Argentaria's first interim dividend was 125 pesetas. The total dividend paid against 1995 results was 270 pesetas gross.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
